WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.195 --> 00:00:06.205
The booking page on a phone shows the services this user may book.

2
00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:08.653
Pick the service you need.

3
00:00:08.653 --> 00:00:14.042
Green days have a free slot. Pick a day.

4
00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:18.847
Only free times are listed. Choose one.

5
00:00:18.847 --> 00:00:23.529
The time is held for you for a few minutes; the countdown shows how long.

6
00:00:23.529 --> 00:00:30.600
Confirm. The appointment lands in your calendar with an invitation.

